      </eAnnotations>
      <eAnnotations source="http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel">
        <details key="documentation" value="An extrinsic method for installing software on this physical computer system. If 0 is returned, the function completed successfully and no ConcreteJob instance was required. The return value shall be 1 if the request is not supported, and 2 if an error occurred. If 4096 is returned, a ConcreteJob will be started to to perform the install. The Job's reference will be returned in the output parameter Job."/>
      </eAnnotations>
