    <eAnnotations source="http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel">
      <details key="documentation" value="The use of this association is being deprecated in lieu of using AssociatedSensor, since the use of the referenced class VoltageSensor is deprecated. &#xA;A PowerSupply may have an associated VoltageSensor, monitoring its input voltage. This is described by this association."/>
